        "text": "- Home\n- Donate\n- Statement\n- Issues\n- Meet Mindy\n- Endorsments\n- Contact Us\n- Press\n- Gallery\n- Videos\n# Mindy Invites All Oaklanders to Celebrate America's 250th Birthday!\n### Mindy Invites All Oaklanders to Celebrate America's 250th Birthday!\n### Mindy Invites All Oaklanders to Celebrate America's 250th Birthday!\n### Mindy Invites All Oaklanders to Celebrate America's 250th Birthday!\n### Mindy Invites All Oaklanders to Celebrate America's 250th Birthday!\n### Mindy Invites All Oaklanders to Celebrate America's 250th Birthday!\nDonate Now\nDONATE NOW\nLatest Press Releases\nEndorsements\n## Mindy Pechenuk: Oakland's Homeless Policy Is A Failure!\n#### Concrete Blocs and Evictions Do Not Work\nI am leading the fight, alongside my dear friends and fellow Oaklanders, to put an end to the inhumane treatment of homeless people in our city.\nI have personally visited Oakland’s homeless encampments, including Hawley Street and 75th Avenue. I have seen the eviction notices, the bulldozers, and the massive concrete blocks put in place.\nThis is not the American solution. This is a failure of leadership and humanity.\nPhoto by Mindy Pechenuk-75th and Hawley\n## Oakland Has A Choice!\n#### There Is An Election November 3, 2026\nVote Mindy Pechenuk\nOakland Celebrates Americas 250th: 1776-2026\n## More Jobs for Oaklanders.\n#### No more bonds and no more debt\nOakland doesn’t need another bond measure.\nWe need business.\nNo more bonds — because more bonds means more debt.\nWhile others keep pushing more taxes and more debt. I will put an end to that vicious cycle.\nI’m talking about Physical AI. Robots. Advanced manufacturing. Real production. Companies are already looking at West Oakland. The question is: who gets the jobs? ]\nUnder my administration? Only Oaklanders. Physical AI apprentice programs.\nOakland kids. Oakland adults. Oakland workers.\nTrained here. Hired here. Paid here.\nNo more bonds. More business.\nJobs for Oaklanders.\nI’m Mindy Pechenuk.\nMake Oakland work again.\nVote Mindy. November 3rd.\n## Oakland Has A Choice!\n#### There Is An Election November 3, 2026\nContrary to popular opinion by the political insiders, Barbara Lee has not already won the November 3rd, 2026 election. It is still yours to take. I'm Mindy Pechnuk for Oakland Mayor. The only one who has shown Oakland a future.\nBarbara Lee, the Bontes, Shang Tao, and Gavin Newsome wrecked this city, then told you\nto accept it. I will never surrender to that self-appointed royalty. I love Oakland.\n## Permitting in 30 Days or less\n#### Permitting in 30 Days or Less\nTogether we will rebuild Oakalnd\n“Ad generated or substantially altered using artificial intelligence.”\n## Time To Grow Oakland and Stop The Steal\n#### Rebuild Oakland the American Way!\nMindy's vision for our Oakland-\n“Ad generated or substantially altered using artificial intelligence.”\n## Recent Statements from Mindy\n#### Rebuild Oakland the American Way!\nMindy's vision for our Oakland-\n“Ad generated or substantially altered using artificial intelligence.”\n## Recent Statements from Mindy\n#### Our Oakland Children Deserve To Have A Future\nMindy's vision for our children-\n“Ad generated or substantially altered using artificial intelligence.”\n## Recent Statements from Mindy\n#### Mindy Rebuilding Oakland\nMindy Pechenuk takes on Mayor Barbara Lee and Oakland City Council. Mindy's vision for Oakland homelessness.\n“Ad generated or substantially altered using artificial intelligence.”\n“Ad generated or substantially altered using artificial intelligence.”\nDonate Now\n## Mindy Speaks\n#### Mindy Returns To The Streets\nMindy Pechenuk speaks out against homelessness. Mindy has solutions and it is not about more money!\n#### Mindy's Testimony At Oakland City Council\nMindy Pechenuk speaks out against Queen Barbara Lees \"Strong Mayor\" Charter Reform\n## Contact Us\nCopyright © 2026 Paid for by Pechenuk for Oakland Mayor 2026 FPPC# 1480943 - All Rights Reserved.\nPowered by\n- Home\n- Donate\n- Statement\n- Issues\n- Meet Mindy\n- Endorsments\n- Contact Us\n- Gallery\n- Videos\n### SUPPORT MINDY Subscribe to Our Newsletter\nSign Up Now\n#### This website uses cookies.\nWe use cookies to analyze website traffic and optimize your website experience. By accepting our use of cookies, your data will be aggregated with all other user data.\nAccept",
